{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Tatsuki Fujimoto 17-26","An anthology series adapting 8 short stories created by manga artist Tatsuki Fujimoto between ages 17 and 26.\n\n\n\n1) A Couple Clucking Chickens Were Still Kickin' in the Schoolyard (Dir. Seishirou Nagaya, ZEXCS)\n\n\n2) Sasaki Stopped a Bullet (Dir. Nobukage Kimura, Lapin Track)\n\n\n3) Love is Blind (Dir. Nobuyuki Takeuchi, Lapin Track)\n\n\n4) Shikaku (Dir. Naoya Ando, GRAPH77)\n\n\n5) Mermaid Rhapsody (Dir. Tetsuaki Watanabe, 100Studio)\n\n\n6) Woke-Up-as-a-Girl Syndrome (Dir. Kazuaki Terasawa, Studio Kafka)\n\n\n7) Nayuta of the Prophecy (Dir. Tetsuaki Watanabe, 100Studio)\n\n\n8) Sisters (Dir. Osamu Honma, P.A.WORKS)\n\n\n\nNote: This anime had a pre-release world premiere at the \"Global Stage Hollywood 2025\" film festival on October 5, 2025. A general two-week theatrical run in Japan divided into two parts released on the same day October 17, 2025. The anime series later streamed worldwide in Amazon Prime Video on November 8, 2025."],"ja":["藤本タツキ 17-26",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-62405","ids":{"shikimori":62405,"mal":62405,"anilist":198188,"kodik":"serial-71387"},"kodikIds":["serial-71386","serial-71385","serial-71387"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-71386":"2025-11-11T20:35:17Z","serial-71385":"2025-11-07T18:50:22Z","serial-71387":"2025-11-14T16:35:26Z"},"title":"Тацуки Фудзимото: С семнадцати до двадцати шести","originalTitle":"Fujimoto Tatsuki 17-26","alt":"Тацуки Фуджимото: С 17 до 26 / Тацуки Фудзимото: С семнадцати до двадцати шести Tatsuki Fujimoto 17-26 藤本タツキ 17-26","description":"Шесть аниме студий и семь режиссёров адаптировали ранние работы , автора культовой манги « Человека-бензопилы ». Аниме-антология, где каждый эпизод — это короткая история, нарисованная автором в возрасте от семнадцати до двадцати шести лет, включая первую работу, поданную на конкурс. 1. «На школьном дворе всё ещё кудахтали две курицы» (режиссёр Сэйсиро Нагая ); 2. «Сасаки остановил пулю» (режиссёр Нобукагэ Кимура ); 3. «Любовь слепа» (режиссёр Нобуюки Такэути ); 4. «Сикаку» (режиссёр Наоя Андо ); 5. «Рапсодия русалки» (режиссёр Тэцуаки Ватанабэ ); 6. «Синдром пробуждения в женском обличье» (режиссёр Кадзуаки Тэрасава ); 7. «Наюта из пророчества» (режиссёр Тэцуаки Ватанабэ ); 8. «Сёстры» (режиссёр Сю Хомма ).","year":2025,"type":"ONA","genres":["Сёнен","Экшен","Комедия","Драма","Романтика","Сверхъестественное","Школа"],"rating":8.02,"popularity":51056,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/62405/6f55973dda7e6174d1c99828e8572e7a.jpeg","width":700,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/198188-rIqUa8loin9T.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-3207","dubId":"3207","label":"FoxForce","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-71386","translationId":"3207","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1531319/d336ca25b2ef7938ec24c76865259848/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-3991","dubId":"3991","label":"Amazon.Subtitles","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-71385","translationId":"3991","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1531295/afe1812d0aa3769f4eadd51cf4485c7e/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-1554","dubId":"1554","label":"FSG Sanae.Subtitles","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-71387","translationId":"1554","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1531323/2d5df9ecc1bb45fa7217431db98